{"id":1376,"date":"2025-01-15T17:16:14","date_gmt":"2025-01-15T09:16:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/?p=1376"},"modified":"2025-01-22T16:21:41","modified_gmt":"2025-01-22T08:21:41","slug":"reflecting-on-2024-achievements-and-shaping-2025-goals","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/reflecting-on-2024-achievements-and-shaping-2025-goals\/","title":{"rendered":"Reflecting on 2024 Achievements and Shaping 2025 Goals"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1376\" class=\"elementor elementor-1376\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6db9b06 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6db9b06\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6292b8c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6292b8c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p>At Vulcan Shield Global, 2024 was nothing short of transformative. It was a year that saw us pushing the boundaries of innovation, expanding our capabilities, and achieving significant milestones that have strengthened our position as a global leader in alumina fiber research, development, and production. From groundbreaking advancements in product performance to the establishment of new manufacturing capabilities, we have not only addressed the evolving needs of our customers but also set new benchmarks for the high-performance materials industry.<\/p><p>As we step into 2025, we remain steadfast in our commitment to delivering cutting-edge solutions that empower industries to tackle their most challenging high-temperature applications. We take immense pride in sharing our key achievements from the past year and unveiling our ambitious plans for the future\u2014plans that will further enhance the capabilities of alumina fiber materials and expand their applications across aerospace, petrochemicals, energy, electronics, and beyond.<\/p><p>With innovation at the heart of everything we do, VSG is poised to lead the charge in creating sustainable, high-performance materials that not only meet but exceed industry expectations. Join us as we reflect on our successes in 2024 and outline the exciting initiatives that will shape the next chapter of our journey.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3363020 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3363020\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31da6c3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"31da6c3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3><strong>2024 Achievements: Pioneering New Heights in Alumina Fiber Technology<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cc0e2b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3cc0e2b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><b>1. Breakthroughs in M-99 Continuous Fiber<\/b><\/h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c93b15e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c93b15e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1406\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber.png 1440w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9f6441 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b9f6441\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/m-99-fiber\/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>M-99<\/u><\/a>, our alumina fiber with 99% alumina content, underwent transformative improvements in 2024. One of the greatest challenges we faced was enhancing its strength and modulus, key performance indicators that our customers across industries had eagerly anticipated. After countless trials and extensive R&amp;D efforts, we succeeded in:<\/p><ul><li>Improving the strength and modulus of\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/m-99-fiber\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>M-99<\/u><\/a>\u00a0to meet and exceed industry expectations.<\/li><li>Transforming\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/m-99-fiber\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>M-99<\/u><\/a>\u00a0into\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-woven-fabric\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>woven fabric<\/u><\/a>\u00a0and unidirectional fabric, unlocking its potential for a wide array of applications across industries such as aerospace, energy, and advanced composites.<\/li><\/ul><p>These advancements are a testament to our dedication to innovation and customer-centric development.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c36e5b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6c36e5b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f07ad01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f07ad01\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">2. The Only Enterprise in the World Capable of Manufacturing both Long and Short Alumina Fibers<\/strong><\/h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba98388 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ba98388\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Guangxi-Plant.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1410\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Guangxi-Plant.png 1440w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Guangxi-Plant-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Guangxi-Plant-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Guangxi-Plant-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb14b46 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bb14b46\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>One of our proudest achievements in 2024 was the opening of our state-of-the-art manufacturing plant in Guangxi. This milestone makes Vulcan Shield Global the <b>only enterprise in the world capable of manufacturing both\u00a0<\/b><a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/products\/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>long and short alumina fibers<\/u>.<\/a><\/p><ul><li><strong>Enhanced Customization<\/strong>: Whether long or short fiber is required, VSG provides tailored solutions for diverse applications, from thermal insulation to composite reinforcement.<\/li><li><strong>Increased Production Capacity<\/strong>: With this facility, we can meet growing global demand while maintaining the highest quality standards.<\/li><li><strong>Cost Efficiency<\/strong>: Streamlined production processes and economies of scale translate into competitive pricing for our customers.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>The addition of our plant in Guangxi plant solidifies VSG\u2019s position as a global leader in alumina fiber manufacturing, ensuring our customers have access to reliable, cutting-edge materials for even the most demanding applications.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5b3324 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e5b3324\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f11ff8a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f11ff8a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong>3. Expanding Our Global Footprint<\/strong><\/h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b6af11 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6b6af11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/VSG-Team.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1412\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/VSG-Team.png 1440w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/VSG-Team-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/VSG-Team-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/VSG-Team-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6094797 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6094797\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In 2024, we at Vulcan Shield Global expanded our reach to serve industry leaders in aerospace, petrochemicals, and advanced materials across the USA, Germany, Malaysia, Indonesia, and beyond. By building relationships with top-tier clients, we\u2019ve strengthened our role as a trusted supplier of high-performance materials in critical industries.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46f0033 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"46f0033\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-408d97a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"408d97a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3><strong>2025 Goals: Innovating for Sustainable and High-Performance Solutions\n<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd0396f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"cd0396f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80a19de elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"80a19de\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong>1. Researching New Applications<\/strong><\/h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c27e816 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c27e816\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Phone.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1417\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Phone.png 1440w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Phone-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Phone-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Phone-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23abf45 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"23abf45\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>One of our primary goals for 2025 is to explore how VSG\u2019s alumina fiber can revolutionize applications in the 3C (Computer, Communication, Consumer Electronics) industries. With a focus on lightweight, high-strength, and thermally efficient materials, we aim to support advancements in areas such as:<\/p><ul><li>Thermal management systems for electronic devices.<\/li><li>Battery component insulation for next-generation energy storage solutions.<\/li><li>Electromagnetic shielding in consumer electronics.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-225f593 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"225f593\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-39790a6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"39790a6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">2. Enhancing Product Specifications<\/strong><\/h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d41ed99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d41ed99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Fire-Test.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1416\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Fire-Test.png 1440w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Fire-Test-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Fire-Test-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Alumina-Fiber-Fire-Test-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f76f2e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1f76f2e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Continuous improvement is at the core of VSG\u2019s mission. In 2025, we plan to further refine the technical specifications of our\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/products\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>long and short alumina fibers<\/u><\/a>, including:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Higher strength and modulus<\/strong> to expand their use in advanced composites and extreme environments.<\/li><li><strong>Enhanced thermal resistance<\/strong> for critical applications in aerospace energy sectors.<\/li><li><strong>Improved flexibility and customization<\/strong> to meet the needs of diverse industries.<\/li><\/ul><div><\/div><div><p><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"><br \/>2025 will mark a significant milestone with the <\/span><b style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">i<\/b><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">mprovement and launch of our\u00a0<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/c-85-fiber\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"><u>C-85 Alumina Fiber<\/u><\/a><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">, which boasts 85% alumina content. This next-generation fiber will deliver improved performance metrics, including greater thermal stability and mechanical strength, making it an ideal solution for various high-temperature applications.<\/span><\/p><p>We are also working on transforming\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/c-85-fiber\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>C-85 fibers<\/u><\/a>\u00a0into textile forms, such as\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-woven-fabric\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>woven fabrics<\/u><\/a>\u00a0and\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-woven-tape\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>tapes<\/u><\/a>, to meet the growing demand for customizable and versatile materials. These new forms will enable industries like petrochemicals, energy, and electronics to leverage the exceptional properties of C-85 fibers in innovative ways.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-153a3a1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"153a3a1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d754e51 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d754e51\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">3. Improving Industry Applications<\/strong><\/h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-703fe7e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"703fe7e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Metallurgical.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1418\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Metallurgical.png 1440w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Metallurgical-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Metallurgical-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Metallurgical-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-04377e6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"04377e6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>To solidify our position as a leader in high-temperature insulation, we\u2019re actively researching new industry applications, including:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><b style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">Petrochemical Refineries<\/b><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">: Developing improved fired heater linings and catalyst insulation solutions.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><b>Glass Manufacturing<\/b>: Enhancing roller insulation and protecting furnace linings against wear and heat loss.<\/li>\n<li><b>Electric Vehicles (EVs)<\/b>: Optimizing battery insulation and thermal shields for EVs and hybrid vehicles.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65a603a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"65a603a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-32e3934 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"32e3934\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">4. Strengthening Our Leadership in R&amp;D and Awareness<\/strong><\/h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element el